{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "file:STM32_Hardware/IIC.c",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "IIC.c",
      "filePath": "STM32_Hardware/IIC.c",
      "summary": "实现基于软件模拟的 I2C 通信接口，提供 GPIO 初始化、字节发送/接收以及针对从设备的读写操作。",
      "tags": ["utility", "driver", "i2c", "hardware-abstraction"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "使用底层的 GPIO 开漏输出（GPIO_Mode_Out_OD）来软件模拟 I2C 协议。通过精确的微秒延迟（Delay_us）来控制时序。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:STM32_Hardware/IIC.h",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "IIC.h",
      "filePath": "STM32_Hardware/IIC.h",
      "summary": "声明 software 模拟 I2C 通信的接口函数，定义基础的数据读写 API。",
      "tags": ["type-definition", "driver", "i2c", "header"],
      "complexity": "simple",
      "languageNotes": "标准的 C 语言头文件，采用宏保护防止重复包含。提供软件 I2C 基础接口的公开声明。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:STM32_Hardware/MPU6050.c",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "MPU6050.c",
      "filePath": "STM32_Hardware/MPU6050.c",
      "summary": "提供 MPU6050 六轴传感器的初始化功能，包括自检（Self-Test）、DMP 固件载入、采样率设置以及方向与偏差配置。",
      "tags": ["driver", "sensor", "imu", "hardware-abstraction"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "调用了 InvenSense 官方提供的 motion driver dmp 库。通过配置寄存器与 DMP 固件，实现高精度的姿态数据解算。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:STM32_Hardware/MPU6050_Reg.h",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "MPU6050_Reg.h",
      "filePath": "STM32_Hardware/MPU6050_Reg.h",
      "summary": "定义 MPU6050 的寄存器地址以及各种功能配置选项的宏定义。",
      "tags": ["configuration", "driver", "sensor", "header"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "包含了 MPU6050 芯片的完整寄存器映射（Register Map），使用宏定义了各配置位，为软件驱动提供寄存器级别的操作基础。"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:STM32_Hardware/IIC.c:IIC_Init",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "IIC_Init",
      "filePath": "STM32_Hardware/IIC.c",
      "summary": "初始化软件 I2C 使用的 GPIOB 端口，使能时钟并配置 SDA 和 SCL 引脚为开漏输出模式。",
      "tags": ["initialization", "gpio", "hardware-setup"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:STM32_Hardware/IIC.c:IIC_Send_Byte",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "IIC_Send_Byte",
      "filePath": "STM32_Hardware/IIC.c",
      "summary": "向 I2C 总线串行发送一个字节的数据，通过循环逐位控制 SDA 和 SCL 时序。",
      "tags": ["data-transmission", "i2c-bus", "low-level"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:STM32_Hardware/IIC.c:IIC_Receive_Byte",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "IIC_Receive_Byte",
      "filePath": "STM32_Hardware/IIC.c",
      "summary": "从 I2C 总线串行读取一个字节的数据，并在每读取一位后产生时钟脉冲。",
      "tags": ["data-reception", "i2c-bus", "low-level"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:STM32_Hardware/IIC.c:IIC_write",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "IIC_write",
      "filePath": "STM32_Hardware/IIC.c",
      "summary": "向目标 I2C 从设备的指定寄存器写入指定长度的数据。",
      "tags": ["i2c-write", "data-transmission", "bus-operation"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:STM32_Hardware/IIC.c:IIC_read",
      "type": "function",
      "name": "IIC_read",
      "filePath": "STM32_Hardware/IIC.c",
      "summary": "从目标 I2C 从设备的指定寄存器读取指定长度的数据。",
      "tags": ["i2c-read", "data-reception", "bus-operation"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
