      "type": "function",
      "name": "run_self_test",
      "filePath": "STM32_Hardware/MPU6050.c",
      "summary": "运行 MPU6050 自检程序，如果自检通过，则计算陀螺仪与加速度计的偏差并将其配置给 DMP。",
      "tags": ["self-test", "calibration", "sensor-setup"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
